LittleTiles, SkyTekx build of the upstream branch 1.20
=======================================================

This jar is a build of LittleTiles that SkyTekx made for the SkyTekx 3 modpack (Minecraft 1.20.1,
Forge 47). It is not an official release of LittleTiles. Report problems with it to SkyTekx
(https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server), not to the LittleTiles project.

Original work
-------------
  LittleTiles by CreativeMD and N247S (the authors in its mods.toml)
  Source:   https://github.com/CreativeMD/LittleTiles
  Commit:   c5694e16070fd10460a093df817149128936ba86, the head of the branch 1.20 on 2026-11-05
            (2026-05-08, "Merge pull request #1195 from Deepseasaltyfish/1.20")
  License:  GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only (LGPL-3.0-only, as its mods.toml says). The
            LICENSE file of that commit ships inside this jar as LICENSE_littletiles. The LGPL v3 adds
            permissions to the GNU General Public License v3, whose text ships inside this jar as
            LICENSE_littletiles_GPL-3.0 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt).

Corresponding Source
--------------------
  The Java sources and resources of this jar are those of the commit above, unchanged. That commit
  is 43 commits past 1b58169e ("Bumped version to 1.6.0-pre161", the last release for 1.20.1).
  Among them is 32acae1c "fix hybrid server crash due to empty value of BETiles.tiles".

  It was compiled against the unchanged CreativeCore 2.12.40 jar for Forge 1.20.1 from the Modrinth
  project creativecore (https://github.com/CreativeMD/CreativeCore, LGPL-3.0-only). CreativeCore is
  not part of this jar.

  The jar carries MixinExtras 0.4.1 (io.github.llamalad7:mixinextras-forge, MIT license,
  https://github.com/LlamaLad7/MixinExtras) unchanged under META-INF/jarjar, as the upstream jar does.

Build changes
-------------
  SkyTekx, 2026-11-05. Only the build differs from upstream:
  - The version is 1.6.0-pre161-skytekx.1 instead of 1.6.0-pre161, in the version line of
    META-INF/mods.toml, in the manifest and in the file name. The mod id stays littletiles.
  - LICENSE_littletiles, LICENSE_littletiles_GPL-3.0 and this NOTICE_littletiles were added to the
    jar.
  - It was built with Java 17, ForgeGradle 6 and Forge 1.20.1-47.4.0 by a small Gradle workspace of
    SkyTekx instead of the build files of the upstream repository. The workspace files are in the
    SkyTekx 3 repository, folder ports/littletiles:
    https://github.com/skytekx/skytekx3-1201-server/tree/master/ports/littletiles
  - It compiles against the Embeddium 0.3.20 release of Modrinth instead of the git build
    0.3.20-git-b21cfd8 that upstream names, and against two empty compile-only stand-ins for the
    Fabric API types FabricBlockView and RenderAttachedBlockView, which that Embeddium build brings
    upstream. The Fabric annotations Environment and EnvType come from the forge sources of
    CreativeCore at commit 4138056ac47874a1de3e4211e5ee5c6767fe1664 (version 2.12.40), as in the
    workspace of upstream. None of these is part of the jar, and no class of LittleTiles names the
    two Fabric API types.
